<title>MALAYSIA: Pacific Chemicals 1996 net down 21.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Pacific Chemicals 1996 net down 21.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 29.01   vs	36.79</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	26.3    vs	33.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		  141.97   vs    138.33</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   39.48   vs     49.02</p>
<p>    Minorities		   -     vs	-</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    -     vs	-</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)	8.0    vs	6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Pacific Chemicals Bhd is involved in the trading of logs and production of sawn timber.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
